<template>
  <main class="qag-space qag-admin">
    <header class="qaa-hero"><div><span class="qag-eyebrow">QGAUSS / PARTNER CONTROL ROOM</span><h1>把专业能力，<br>接入你的行动小队<span>。</span></h1><p>从连接、认识到正式出场。每一位搭档，都有清楚的身份、能力与费用。</p><div><button class="qag-primary" type="button" :disabled="busy" @click="editConnection()">添加服务连接<ClientIcon name="plus" /></button><router-link class="qag-text-link" to="/agent">看看前台搭档馆<ClientIcon name="arrowUpRight" /></router-link></div></div><div class="qaa-sculpture" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><span>Q</span><b>CONNECTED<br>WITH INTENTION</b><em>✦</em></div></header>
    <ol class="qaa-journey"><li><b>01</b><span>建立连接<small>凭据加密保存，手动核对授权</small></span><strong>{{ connections.length }}</strong></li><li><b>02</b><span>认识搭档<small>导入为草稿，审阅资料与费用</small></span><strong>{{ bots.length }}</strong></li><li><b>03</b><span>准备出场<small>发布后，用户可明确开启协作</small></span><strong>{{ bots.filter(x=>x.published).length }}</strong></li></ol>
    <div class="qaa-section-head"><nav class="qaa-tabs" aria-label="搭档管理"><button v-for="tab in tabs" :key="tab.key" type="button" :aria-pressed="section===tab.key" @click="section=tab.key">{{ tab.title }}</button></nav><button class="qag-secondary" type="button" :disabled="loading||busy" @click="load">刷新状态<ClientIcon name="refresh" /></button></div>
    <p v-if="error" class="qaa-error" role="alert">{{ error }}</p><p v-if="notice" class="qaa-notice" role="status">{{ notice }}</p><div v-if="loading" class="qag-detail-loading"><BrandLoader text="正在整理搭档控制室…" :size="48" /></div>
    <template v-else-if="section==='connections'">
      <div class="qaa-cards"><article v-for="connection in connections" :key="connection.id" class="qaa-card"><header><span class="qaa-card-symbol"><ClientIcon name="connection" /></span><div><h2>{{ connection.name }}</h2><small>Coze · {{ connection.authMode==='JWT'?'OAuth 签名授权':'访问令牌授权' }}</small></div><span class="qaa-status">{{ !connection.enabled?'已暂停':connection.hasCredential?'已配置':'待补凭据' }}</span></header><p class="qaa-address">{{ connection.baseUrl }}</p><dl><div><dt>空间 ID</dt><dd>{{ connection.spaceId||'尚未设置' }}</dd></div><div><dt>授权核对</dt><dd>{{ connection.lastProbeOk===true?'列表读取已通过':connection.lastProbeOk===false?'最近一次未通过':'尚未核对' }}<small v-if="connection.lastProbeAt">{{ date(connection.lastProbeAt) }}</small></dd></div></dl><footer><button type="button" :disabled="busy" @click="editConnection(connection)">编辑连接</button><button type="button" :disabled="busy||!connection.hasCredential" @click="probe(connection)">核对授权</button><button type="button" :disabled="busy||!connection.hasCredential||!connection.spaceId" @click="discover(connection)">发现搭档</button><button class="qaa-danger" type="button" :disabled="busy" @click="removeConnection(connection)">移除</button></footer></article></div><div v-if="!connections.length" class="qag-empty"><span>✧</span><h2>为行动小队，打开第一条连接。</h2><p>先保存服务地址与授权方式。凭据可以稍后补齐，保存本身不会连接外部服务。</p><button class="qag-primary" type="button" @click="editConnection()">添加服务连接<ClientIcon name="plus" /></button></div>
      <p class="qaa-footnote">核对授权只读取空间或已发布搭档列表，不会发起生成；它不代表所有搭档都已通过真实对话验收。</p>
    </template>
    <template v-else-if="section==='bots'">
      <div class="qaa-section-head"><p>导入资料、设置报价，再决定何时发布。</p><button class="qag-primary" type="button" :disabled="busy||!connections.length" @click="editBot()">手动添加搭档<ClientIcon name="plus" /></button></div>
      <div class="qaa-cards"><article v-for="bot in bots" :key="bot.id" class="qaa-card"><header><span class="qaa-card-symbol"><ClientIcon name="agent" /></span><div><h2>{{ bot.name }}</h2><small>{{ bot.connection?.name||'原连接' }} · {{ bot.published?'已发布':'草稿' }}</small></div><span class="qaa-status">{{ bot.countCost?bot.countCost+' 次 / 完成':'不扣次数' }}</span></header><p>{{ bot.description||'还没有专长介绍。' }}</p><div class="qag-tags"><span v-for="tag in bot.tags" :key="tag">{{ tag }}</span></div><small class="qaa-identity">搭档 ID · {{ bot.botId }}</small><footer><button type="button" :disabled="busy" @click="editBot(bot)">编辑资料与费用</button><button type="button" :disabled="busy||!bot.connection?.enabled||!!bot.connection?.deletedAt" @click="syncBot(bot)">同步资料</button><button type="button" :disabled="busy" @click="publishBot(bot)">{{ bot.published?'下架':'发布' }}</button><button class="qaa-danger" type="button" :disabled="busy" @click="removeBot(bot)">移除</button></footer></article></div><div v-if="!bots.length" class="qag-empty"><span>♧</span><h2>小队正在等第一位搭档。</h2><p>在服务连接上点击「发现搭档」，或使用搭档 ID 手动添加。导入后的新搭档会先保留为草稿。</p></div><p class="qaa-footnote">这里的单次报价仅在商业化开关开启时生效。资料同步保留已有费用、标签与发布状态；新报价需要用户刷新确认。</p>
    </template>
    <template v-else><div class="qaa-section-head"><p>最近 40 轮协作。生成结果、次数结算与取消回执分别展示。</p></div><div class="qaa-receipts"><article v-for="receipt in receipts" :key="receipt.messageId" class="qaa-receipt"><header><span class="qaa-card-symbol"><ClientIcon name="agent" /></span><div><h2>{{ receipt.agent?.name||'原搭档' }}</h2><small>{{ date(receipt.createdAt) }}</small></div><b>{{ status(receipt.status) }}</b></header><div class="qaa-receipt-facts"><span>预留 <b>{{ receipt.reservedAmount }}</b></span><span>已消费 <b>{{ receipt.chargedAmount }}</b></span><span>退回可用 <b>{{ receipt.returnedAmount }}</b></span><span v-if="receipt.expiredAmount">到期结束 <b>{{ receipt.expiredAmount }}</b></span><span>{{ receipt.contextMode==='continued'?'接续当前分支':'独立服务方会话' }}</span></div><AgentRunPanel v-if="receipt.activity" :value="{...receipt.activity,...(receipt.cancelState==='accepted'||receipt.cancelState==='unknown'?{cancellation:receipt.cancelState}:{})}" disabled /></article></div><div v-if="!receipts.length" class="qag-empty"><span>◌</span><h2>完成一次协作，回执会留在这里。</h2><p>暂时没有智能体协作记录。</p></div><p class="qaa-footnote">服务方接受取消请求后，其计算或用量仍可能继续；本站不会自动重新发起生成。</p></template>

    <dialog ref="connectionDialog" class="qaa-dialog" aria-labelledby="qaa-connection-title" @cancel="guardClose" @close="clearConnection"><form @submit.prevent="saveConnection"><header><div><span class="qag-eyebrow">A TRUSTED CONNECTION</span><h2 id="qaa-connection-title">{{ connectionForm.id?'编辑服务连接':'建立一条新连接' }}</h2></div><button type="button" aria-label="关闭连接编辑" :disabled="busy" @click="connectionDialog.close()">×</button></header><p>保存配置不会联系外部服务。凭据加密保存；已保存的凭据不会回显。</p><label>连接名称<input v-model="connectionForm.name" maxlength="64" required /></label><label>服务根地址<input v-model="connectionForm.baseUrl" type="url" placeholder="https://api.coze.cn" maxlength="2048" required /></label><label>授权方式<select v-model="connectionForm.authMode"><option value="JWT">OAuth JWT 签名授权</option><option value="PAT">个人访问令牌</option></select></label><div v-if="connectionForm.authMode==='JWT'" class="qaa-form-pair"><label>应用 ID<input v-model="connectionForm.appId" maxlength="256" required /></label><label>公钥指纹<input v-model="connectionForm.publicKeyId" maxlength="256" required /></label></div><label>{{ connectionForm.authMode==='JWT'?'RSA 私钥':'访问令牌' }}<textarea v-if="connectionForm.authMode==='JWT'" v-model="connectionForm.secret" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" rows="4" maxlength="16384" :placeholder="connectionForm.id?'留空沿用已保存的凭据':'可稍后填写，暂不开放协作'"></textarea><input v-else v-model="connectionForm.secret" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" maxlength="8192" :placeholder="connectionForm.id?'留空沿用已保存的凭据':'可稍后填写'" /></label><div class="qaa-form-pair"><label>空间 ID<input v-model="connectionForm.spaceId" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]*" maxlength="64" placeholder="用于发现已发布搭档" /></label><label>等待上限（秒）<input v-model.number="connectionForm.timeoutSeconds" type="number" min="5" max="180" step="1" required /></label></div><label class="qaa-check"><input v-model="connectionForm.enabled" type="checkbox" />允许这条连接开启新协作</label><p v-if="formError" class="qaa-error" role="alert">{{ formError }}</p><footer><button class="qag-secondary" type="button" :disabled="busy" @click="connectionDialog.close()">稍后再说</button><button class="qag-primary" type="submit" :disabled="busy">{{ busy?'正在保存…':'保存连接' }}<ClientIcon name="check" /></button></footer></form></dialog>

    <dialog ref="botDialog" class="qaa-dialog" aria-labelledby="qaa-bot-title" @cancel="guardClose"><form @submit.prevent="saveBot"><header><div><span class="qag-eyebrow">READY FOR A GOOD PARTNER</span><h2 id="qaa-bot-title">{{ botForm.id?'整理搭档档案':'认识一位新搭档' }}</h2></div><button type="button" aria-label="关闭搭档编辑" :disabled="busy" @click="botDialog.close()">×</button></header><div class="qaa-form-pair"><label>服务连接<select v-model="botForm.connectionId" :disabled="!!botForm.id" required><option value="" disabled>选择连接</option><option v-for="item in connections" :key="item.id" :value="item.id">{{ item.name }}</option></select></label><label>服务方搭档 ID<input v-model="botForm.botId" :disabled="!!botForm.id" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{1,64}" maxlength="64" required /></label></div><label>显示名称<input v-model="botForm.name" maxlength="64" required /></label><label>专长介绍<textarea v-model="botForm.description" maxlength="2000" rows="3"></textarea></label><label>开场问候<textarea v-model="botForm.greeting" maxlength="4000" rows="3"></textarea></label><label>专长标签（每行一个，最多 8 个）<textarea v-model="botForm.tags" rows="2"></textarea></label><label>推荐问题（每行一个，最多 6 个）<textarea v-model="botForm.questions" rows="3"></textarea></label><div class="qaa-form-pair"><label>每次完成消耗的智能体次数<input v-model.number="botForm.countCost" type="number" min="0" max="1000000" step="1" required /></label><label>展示顺序<input v-model.number="botForm.sort" type="number" min="-1000000" max="1000000" step="1" required /></label></div><label class="qaa-check"><input v-model="botForm.published" type="checkbox" />在前台发布这位搭档</label><p>失败或中断释放未消费的预留；已到期的会员次数会随有效期结束。这里不会修改服务方搭档本身。</p><p v-if="formError" class="qaa-error" role="alert">{{ formError }}</p><footer><button class="qag-secondary" type="button" :disabled="busy" @click="botDialog.close()">暂不修改</button><button class="qag-primary" type="submit" :disabled="busy">{{ busy?'正在保存…':'保存搭档资料' }}<ClientIcon name="check" /></button></footer></form></dialog>

    <dialog ref="discoveryDialog" class="qaa-dialog qaa-discovery" aria-labelledby="qaa-discover-title" @cancel="guardClose"><header><div><span class="qag-eyebrow">MEET YOUR NEXT PARTNER</span><h2 id="qaa-discover-title">{{ discoveryConnection?.name }} · 已发布搭档</h2></div><button type="button" aria-label="关闭发现搭档" :disabled="busy" @click="discoveryDialog.close()">×</button></header><p>只读取此空间已发布到 API 的搭档。所选搭档将读取最新资料后导入；新搭档保存为草稿。</p><BrandLoader v-if="discoverLoading" text="正在认识这个空间里的搭档…" :size="40" /><template v-else><label v-for="bot in discovered" :key="bot.botId" class="qaa-discover-option"><input v-model="selectedBots" type="checkbox" :value="bot.botId" :disabled="busy" /><span><b>{{ bot.name }}</b><small>{{ bot.description||'尚无专长介绍' }}</small></span></label><p v-if="!discovered.length">这一页没有找到已发布搭档。</p><nav class="qag-pagination" aria-label="发现搭档分页"><button type="button" :disabled="discoverPage<=1||busy" @click="discover(discoveryConnection,discoverPage-1)">上一页</button><span>第 {{ discoverPage }} 页</span><button type="button" :disabled="!discoverHasMore||busy" @click="discover(discoveryConnection,discoverPage+1)">下一页</button></nav></template><label>新搭档每次完成消耗的次数<input v-model.number="importCost" type="number" min="0" max="1000000" step="1" required /></label><p>已有搭档会更新资料，保留原有费用与发布状态。</p><p v-if="formError" class="qaa-error" role="alert">{{ formError }}</p><footer><button class="qag-secondary" type="button" :disabled="busy" @click="discoveryDialog.close()">稍后再选</button><button class="qag-primary" type="button" :disabled="busy||discoverLoading||!selectedBots.length" @click="importBots">{{ busy?'正在导入…':'将 '+selectedBots.length+' 位搭档导入' }}<ClientIcon name="arrowUpRight" /></button></footer></dialog>
  </main>
</template>
<script setup>
import {computed,nextTick,onBeforeUnmount,onMounted,reactive,ref,watch} from 'vue';
import {ElMessageBox} from 'element-plus';
import {api} from '../../api/client.js';
import {useAuth} from '../../stores/auth.js';
import ClientIcon from '../../components/reference/ClientIcon.vue';
import BrandLoader from '../../components/design/BrandLoader.vue';
import AgentRunPanel from '../../components/design/AgentRunPanel.vue';
import '../../components/design/agent-space.css';
import '../../components/design/agent-studio.css';
const auth=useAuth(),connections=ref([]),bots=ref([]),receipts=ref([]),loading=ref(true),busy=ref(false),error=ref(''),notice=ref(''),section=ref('connections'),formError=ref('');
const tabs=[{key:'connections',title:'服务连接'},{key:'bots',title:'搭档档案'},{key:'receipts',title:'协作回执'}];
const connectionDialog=ref(null),botDialog=ref(null),discoveryDialog=ref(null),connectionForm=reactive({}),botForm=reactive({}),discoveryConnection=ref(null),discovered=ref([]),selectedBots=ref([]),discoverPage=ref(1),discoverTotal=ref(null),discoverLoading=ref(false),importCost=ref(1),discoverHasMore=computed(()=>discoverTotal.value===null?discovered.value.length===20:discoverPage.value*20<discoverTotal.value);
let active=true,read=null,write=null,discoveryRead=null;const stamp=()=>auth.identityRevision,current=identity=>active&&auth.isAdmin&&auth.identityRevision===identity;
const date=value=>{const time=new Date(value);return Number.isNaN(time.getTime())?'时间待确认':time.toLocaleString('zh-CN',{hour12:false});},status=value=>({PENDING:'准备中',STREAMING:'协作中',SETTLING:'结算中',COMPLETED:'已完成',ABORTED:'已中断',FAILED:'未完成'})[value]||'待确认';
async function load(){if(!auth.isAdmin)return;read?.abort();const request=new AbortController(),identity=stamp();read=request;loading.value=true;error.value='';try{const [c,b,r]=await Promise.all([api.get('/agents/admin/connections',{signal:request.signal,retry:false}),api.get('/agents/admin/list',{signal:request.signal,retry:false}),api.get('/agents/admin/receipts',{signal:request.signal,retry:false})]);if(current(identity)&&!request.signal.aborted){if(![c,b,r].every(Array.isArray))throw Error('搭档资料尚未确认');connections.value=c;bots.value=b;receipts.value=r;}}catch(e){if(current(identity)&&!request.signal.aborted)error.value=e.message||'控制室暂未读取成功，请刷新。';}finally{if(read===request){loading.value=false;read=null;}}}
async function action(work,success,{dialog=false}={}){if(busy.value||!auth.isAdmin)return;const request=new AbortController(),identity=stamp();write=request;busy.value=true;error.value=formError.value=notice.value='';try{const result=await work(request.signal);if(!current(identity)||request.signal.aborted)return;notice.value=typeof success==='function'?success(result):success;return{ok:true,result};}catch(e){if(current(identity)&&!request.signal.aborted){const message=e.message||'结果暂未确认，请先刷新状态再决定是否重试。';if(dialog)formError.value=message;else error.value=message;}}finally{if(write===request){busy.value=false;write=null;}}}
async function editConnection(row){if(busy.value)return;Object.assign(connectionForm,{id:row?.id||'',version:row?.version,name:row?.name||'',baseUrl:row?.baseUrl||'https://api.coze.cn',authMode:row?.authMode||'JWT',appId:row?.appId||'',publicKeyId:row?.publicKeyId||'',secret:'',spaceId:row?.spaceId||'',timeoutSeconds:(row?.timeoutMs||60000)/1000,enabled:row?.enabled??true});formError.value='';await nextTick();connectionDialog.value.showModal();}
function clearConnection(){connectionForm.secret='';}
function guardClose(event){if(busy.value)event.preventDefault();}
async function saveConnection(){const {id,timeoutSeconds,...body}=connectionForm;if(!Number.isInteger(timeoutSeconds)||timeoutSeconds<5||timeoutSeconds>180){formError.value='等待上限需为 5 至 180 秒的整数';return;}const response=await action(signal=>id?api.patch('/agents/admin/connections/'+id,{...body,timeoutMs:timeoutSeconds*1000},{signal,retry:false}):api.post('/agents/admin/connections',{...body,timeoutMs:timeoutSeconds*1000},{signal,retry:false}),'连接已保存。需要时点击「核对授权」确认。',{dialog:true});if(response?.ok){connectionDialog.value.close();clearConnection();await load();}}
async function probe(row){const identity=stamp(),result=await action(signal=>api.post('/agents/admin/connections/'+row.id+'/probe',{}, {signal,retry:false}),'授权核对通过：已读取列表。真实协作仍需单独体验验收。');if(!current(identity))return;const previous=error.value;await load();if(current(identity)&&previous)error.value=previous;}
async function confirm(message){const identity=stamp();try{await ElMessageBox.confirm(message,'请核对这次修改',{confirmButtonText:'确认修改',cancelButtonText:'保留现状',type:'warning'});return current(identity);}catch{return false;}}
async function removeConnection(row){if(busy.value||!await confirm('移除「'+row.name+'」并暂停使用它的新协作。历史会话和回执会保留。'))return;const result=await action(signal=>api.del('/agents/admin/connections/'+row.id,{signal,retry:false}),'连接已移除，历史记录已保留。');if(result?.ok)await load();}
async function editBot(row){if(busy.value)return;Object.assign(botForm,{id:row?.id||'',connectionId:row?.connectionId||'',botId:row?.botId||'',name:row?.name||'',description:row?.description||'',greeting:row?.greeting||'',tags:(row?.tags||[]).join('\n'),questions:(row?.suggestedQuestions||[]).join('\n'),countCost:row?.countCost??1,sort:row?.sort||0,published:row?.published??false});formError.value='';await nextTick();botDialog.value.showModal();}
const lines=text=>[...new Set(text.split('\n').map(value=>value.trim()).filter(Boolean))];
async function saveBot(){const {id,tags,questions,...body}=botForm,tagRows=lines(tags),questionRows=lines(questions);if(tagRows.length>8||tagRows.some(x=>x.length>24)||questionRows.length>6||questionRows.some(x=>x.length>400)){formError.value='最多 8 个标签（每个 24 字）、6 个问题（每个 400 字）。';return;}const response=await action(signal=>id?api.patch('/agents/admin/bots/'+id,{...body,tags:tagRows,suggestedQuestions:questionRows},{signal,retry:false}):api.post('/agents/admin/bots',{...body,tags:tagRows,suggestedQuestions:questionRows},{signal,retry:false}),'搭档资料已保存，用户发送前会核对最新费用。',{dialog:true});if(response?.ok){botDialog.value.close();await load();}}
async function syncBot(bot){if(busy.value||!await confirm('读取「'+bot.name+'」的最新名称、介绍、问候和推荐问题。已有费用、标签与发布状态会保留。'))return;const result=await action(signal=>api.post('/agents/admin/bots/'+bot.id+'/sync',{}, {signal,retry:false}),'搭档资料已同步，已有费用与发布状态已保留。');if(result?.ok)await load();}
async function publishBot(bot){const result=await action(signal=>api.patch('/agents/admin/bots/'+bot.id,{published:!bot.published},{signal,retry:false}),bot.published?'搭档已下架，新会话无法继续发送。':'搭档已发布，请到前台核对资料与连接。');if(result?.ok)await load();}
async function removeBot(bot){if(busy.value||!await confirm('移除「'+bot.name+'」并停止新的协作。历史记录会保留。'))return;const result=await action(signal=>api.del('/agents/admin/bots/'+bot.id,{signal,retry:false}),'搭档已移除，历史记录已保留。');if(result?.ok)await load();}
async function discover(connection,page=1){if(busy.value||!connection)return;discoveryRead?.abort();const request=new AbortController(),identity=stamp();discoveryRead=request;discoveryConnection.value=connection;selectedBots.value=[];formError.value='';discoverLoading.value=true;await nextTick();if(!discoveryDialog.value.open)discoveryDialog.value.showModal();try{const data=await api.get('/agents/admin/connections/'+connection.id+'/bots?page='+page,{signal:request.signal,retry:false});if(current(identity)&&!request.signal.aborted){discovered.value=data.items;discoverTotal.value=data.total;discoverPage.value=data.page;}}catch(e){if(current(identity)&&!request.signal.aborted){discovered.value=[];formError.value=e.message||'未读取到搭档列表，请稍后重试。';}}finally{if(discoveryRead===request){discoverLoading.value=false;discoveryRead=null;}}}
async function importBots(){if(!selectedBots.value.length||!discoveryConnection.value)return;if(!Number.isInteger(importCost.value)||importCost.value<0||importCost.value>1000000){formError.value='新搭档费用需为 0 至 1000000 的整数';return;}const result=await action(signal=>api.post('/agents/admin/connections/'+discoveryConnection.value.id+'/import',{botIds:[...selectedBots.value],countCost:importCost.value},{signal,retry:false}),data=>'已导入 '+data.imported+' 位搭档。新搭档保留为草稿，请核对后发布。',{dialog:true});if(result?.ok){discoveryDialog.value.close();section.value='bots';await load();}}
function clear(){read?.abort();write?.abort();discoveryRead?.abort();connectionDialog.value?.close();botDialog.value?.close();discoveryDialog.value?.close();connections.value=[];bots.value=[];receipts.value=[];discovered.value=[];selectedBots.value=[];discoveryConnection.value=null;Object.assign(connectionForm,{secret:'',appId:'',publicKeyId:'',spaceId:'',name:'',baseUrl:''});Object.keys(botForm).forEach(key=>delete botForm[key]);busy.value=loading.value=discoverLoading.value=false;error.value=formError.value=notice.value='';}
watch(()=>[auth.identityRevision,auth.isAdmin],()=>{clear();if(auth.isAdmin)void load();});onMounted(()=>{if(auth.isAdmin)void load();else loading.value=false;});onBeforeUnmount(()=>{active=false;clear();});
</script>
